崔杼有郤，欲其敗也。成、彊殺無咎、偃於崔杼家，家皆奔亡。崔杼怒，無人，使一宦者御，見慶封。慶封曰：「請為子誅之。」使崔杼仇盧蒲嫳攻崔氏，殺成、彊，盡滅崔氏，崔杼婦自殺。崔杼毋歸，亦自殺。慶封為相國，專權。","source_term":"生子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji032-052","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"xgd_r31_cmr"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p001169"]},{"id":"xvh_vgj_xa2","label":"成彊母（崔杼前妻未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"其母","mention_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0015"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p065","quote":"其母"}],"id_aliases":["cbr-p001212"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-032","chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","mention_count":6,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0010","c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0045","c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0061","c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0092","c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0114","c-shiji-032-qi:m065-0173"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi:p065"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-032-qi"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji032-052","subject_person_id":"xgd_r31_cmr_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"xgd_r31_cmr","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p065","quote":"景公元年，初，崔杼生子成及彊，其母死，取東郭女，生明。東郭女使其前夫子無咎與其弟偃相崔氏。成有罪，二相急治之，立明為太子。成請老於崔［杼］，崔杼許之，二相弗聽，曰：「崔，宗邑，不可。」成、彊怒，告慶封。慶封與崔杼有郤，欲其敗也。成、彊殺無咎、偃於崔杼家，家皆奔亡。崔杼怒，無人，使一宦者御，見慶封。慶封曰：「請為子誅之。」使崔杼仇盧蒲嫳攻崔氏，殺成、彊，盡滅崔氏，崔杼婦自殺。崔杼毋歸，亦自殺。慶封為相國，專權。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"生子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"逐項保存本文父母、異母兄弟、婚姻及曾祖關係；無咎父未名，偃之其弟指代未定，不由熟知世系補名或闕代。來源記載不當已確證身世。","